<p class="page-help"><?= ($_GET['view']??'')==='table'?'Every submitted answer is available here. Export the full participant list for your event preparations.':($performerRegister?'Review the performance details below. Confirm a performer to issue their free ticket.':'Review registrations below. For paid entries, confirm the transaction in the event’s receiving account before approving.') ?></p>
